Subject: [PATCH 2627/3799] soh: rename func_808237B4 ->
 KaleidoScope_RotatePageSlow

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: steps the pause camera and the rotation counter one notch a frame, landing on the target page for this mode at 64
Defined in soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/soh/Enhancements/TimeSavers/FasterPauseMenu.cpp         | 6 +++---
 .../overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c   | 5 +++--
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/soh/Enhancements/TimeSavers/FasterPauseMenu.cpp b/soh/soh/Enhancements/TimeSavers/FasterPauseMenu.cpp
index 45af00f3a..70ad3aa1d 100644
--- a/soh/soh/Enhancements/TimeSavers/FasterPauseMenu.cpp
+++ b/soh/soh/Enhancements/TimeSavers/FasterPauseMenu.cpp
@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@ extern "C" {
 #include "variables.h"
 #include "z64.h"
